<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-11T15:29:16.775Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:29:16 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard contained a 2,000‑liter mineral oil leak from a submarine cable off Tabango, Leyte, and rescued 29 passengers and crew from a distressed boat in Palawan while suspending sea travel there because of rough seas. The Armed Forces of the Philippines reiterated that it is merely standing up for its rights in the West Philippine Sea, and officials were urged to cool anti-China rhetoric ahead of the ASEAN summit. China Coast Guard continued patrolling waters around Diaoyu Dao and a Chinese survey ship entered Scarborough Shoal, prompting Manila to summon the Chinese ambassador over threatening remarks. 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/week-asia/politics/article/3374030/why-philippines-muzzling-anti-china-rhetoric-ahead-crucial-asean-talks&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxORC1ZTGozbmtGWE83WGl1LWMtXzZPT0NDRDlFSWZTWDBEMklZM0xGem5hSU14SkxCeUZuaXlveXBzbmx2SkZJU3prUVF3THZ3TmFjcEVLX3d5UFIxQ0dGd21wRVp6Vmt3dmllVmFMeGFUTlhSWGpaV0ZxNFRjRXFmUVZRREVTYldLSklJY1ZudGowSEFHeUlhVGJZS29jRlJVUzBHYk5xb3QzUXJ0WElSNnpZWlNjN3h6SlFzRU9QaThLZjl0RWNaTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WJTV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNR2hleDdydllBaERrQmc5cUNtNG9zeEFUejh4M3BMX0tjckFtcjU4c2lNMjdKbVJVYkxFYnRLVzM0V2VFS21xWlJ5ZDFIRlFYSUtqTjFtZG9oZzZYbC1MaUhUM280M3VIbUV2RV84WHB4NnoxakNndlg0OEFLMkltYTZKaTFxQ3hBQmg